00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.330
Truly...

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.420
Have you and your wife gotten along since then?

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.920
My wife and I got a divorce.

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:26.460
It wasn't because of the thing with Hina-chan.
It's was about personality incompatibility.

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:28.920
But-

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:32.460
Oh! But that doesn't mean I'll start trying
to contact Hina-chan or anything like that.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.580
Rest assured.

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.080
