00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:49.920
To do so from my end is...
I kind of feel like something's not right about that.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:57.500
I'd be lying if I said that I don't still have feelings for her,
but she was the one who decided to break up.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.290
It's one thing if she were to contact me,

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:04.790
but it'd be rather selfish for me to seek to reconcile
with her just because I got divorced, you know?

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:11.210
Well, I guess it's a man's foolish pride,
or something like that.

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:12.830
Darlin'...

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:15.500
you've turned into a fine man.

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:20.290
After all, there's nothing more pathetic than a man
who chases a woman after their breakup.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:29.880
Well, and also... she seems to have had
a change of heart as well.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.380
Has Hina-chan been well since then?

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:39.790
Hina-nee... will be moving out soon.

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:44.460
She apparently wants to try living by herself,
so she said she'll move out during this summer break.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.880
I see. Will she be far away?

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:52.960
Tachibana-kun, you don't like the idea?

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:58.210
It might be my fault that she's moving out...

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:03.920
There was a time when we kinda got into a fight,
and then she said she was moving out right after that...

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:08.630
She keeps on getting ready...
And I don't know what to do...

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.580
What did Tachibana-sensei say?

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:15.330
She said she's been wanting to try
living by herself for a while now.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:19.460
But I also think she's just saying that for my sake...

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.830
If that's what Hina-chan is saying,
then that's probably what she means.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:33.380
She's not the kind of girl who would leave out of spite.
I think you can believe what your big sister says.

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:38.790
It's probably not her intention for you to worry so much.

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:44.960
To Natsuo-kun

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.000
Hina-nee...

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:56.250
Is this... a good time...?

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:02.670
What's up? You went wandering
around town today, right?

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.880
Hmm...? Did something bad happen?

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.290
R-Rui?

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:12.330
Don't...

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:15.130
Please don't do something like move out!

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:17.880
Rui...

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:23.580
I know I said I might like him,
but I want you, Hina-nee, to be close to me too.

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:29.330
We've lived together this whole time,
so I don't want to be separated...!

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:33.000
Do I just have to not care about him anymore?

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:36.960
I don't know what to do to make you change your mind...!

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:48.380
It's all right. You don't have to do anything.
Rui, you don't have to change a thing, okay?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:51.500
Rui, you can be free to do what you want to.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.330
In exchange, please let me be free too, okay...?

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:05.380
Don't give me that face.

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:08.670
I'll try to come home on weekends as much as I can...

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.040
Okay...

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.750
Hey, whaddya wanna do after this?

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:19.170
Wanna watch DVDs or something at my place?

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:24.460
Plus, if the two of us want to meet up,
it might be convenient, so...

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:30.710
I'm home!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.510
To Natsuo-kun

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.510
Hina

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:35.830
What's this...?

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:44.710
I've already decided on a place.

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:48.670
Sensei...

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.170
What's up?

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:53.000
You're just standing in front of your room.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:56.580
Huh? Oh, uh... There was some trash at my feet, so...

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:01.040
Make sure to clean it up then.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.460
Uh, yeah...

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:17.000
All right. All right... Stop!

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:22.250
Phew...

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:27.960
At times like this, work gets done quickly
when there are guys helping.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:29.290
That's true.

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:34.250
Isn't it about time to take a break?
I'll go buy lunch for everyone.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:39.290
Even though you're an adult now, I am worried.

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:41.290
Will you be able to do stuff like cook for yourself?

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:43.210
I'll make sure to do so.

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:46.460
Well, if you think of it as serving the purpose
of eventually preparing for married life,

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:48.210
I guess this kind of living is necessary, too.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:53.750
A bride... That's right...
Someday Hina-chan will get married, too...

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:57.460
You're already crying... It's too early to be thinking that...

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:00.750
Well, lately it's like I'm more easily moved to tears...

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:04.040
I knew it. Just as I thought, that key is...!

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.080
I'm being tested.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:16.170
I wasn't able to give her an answer then...
Can I give it to her now?

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:19.040
"Do you have the resolve to do that?"

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:54.540
It's kinda lonely, right?

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:58.920
You know, up until this morning,
this was totally Sensei's room.

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:00.960
Yeah...

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:03.630
It's oddly empty-looking.

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:07.920
It's like, "Oh, she's no longer
in this house anymore"...

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:12.540
Well, it might take a little while to get used to it.
It can't be helped.

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:17.000
At the very least, we should do our best
and not worry our parents-

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:34.750
It might've been even tougher if I was by myself...
We'd been together for a long time, so...

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:38.420
But now, I have you, so...

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:45.710
That's right.

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:51.210
I'm here, as well as Tsukiko-san and my dad.
Let's do our best, as the four of us.

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:57.670
I'll also support you so that you don't get lonely.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.210
As your step-brother...

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:06.080
I'm home!

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:07.540
Welcome home.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:09.920
Oh, are you preparing dinner?

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:11.460
What is it today?

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:13.750
It's ginger-fried pork.

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:18.670
Sounds good! That's Natsuo's favorite. He'll be thrilled.

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:21.710
I see... Too bad.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:22.580
Huh?

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:27.250
He went out a while ago.
He said he might not need dinner.

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:28.290
Where to?

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:30.920
He said to Fumiya-kun's place...

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.330
Tachibana

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.830
Tachibana

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:41.630
Huh...?

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:48.040
Did she step out...?

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:39.460
You surprised me... I thought I'd forgotten
to lock the door or something...

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:43.130
I got tired while I was unpacking.

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:50.540
I was thinking that you didn't need it...
You looked away yesterday, so...

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:55.630
That's not...! I don't think you get
how happy I was when I saw this key...!

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:59.630
Sensei, I... I came here prepared.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:05.830
I wouldn't mind dying together, Sensei, if I was with you...

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:12.330
I... I'm a failure as an adult and as a teacher...

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:17.170
I'm actually thinking how happy I am
about what you just said...

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:44.830
Finally... I got a proper one in.

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:50.040
The kiss from before was when you
forcefully pushed me down and did it.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.960
Oh, yeah. That's right!

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:55.330
Inadvertently, that was my first kiss, you know?

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:56.880
What?! I'm sorry!

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:59.790
My heart was pounding, though.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:01.670
Then...

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:05.250
Overwrite that one with today's, as your first kiss.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:26.330
I might not be able to stop... Is that okay... Sensei...?

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:34.830
Sensei...?

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:39.080
It's not that I don't want to, you know? It's not that, but...

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:42.830
I just think that maybe we don't have to rush into things...

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:47.750
Hang on. I'll make some coffee right now.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:13.080
Don't feel rushed...

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:16.540
Our time together has just started, you know?

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:18.630
There'll be plenty of time from now on.

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:22.750
Let's take it slow and carefully, okay...?

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:25.540
Okay...

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.420
The summer break flew by just like that, you know...?

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:40.000
Did you finish your story for the club publication?

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:41.420
Pretty much.

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:44.040
What theme did you go with in the end?

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:47.130
Sleazy gangster mystery.

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:50.290
What? Gang... Huh? What's that?

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.580
I kinda had a source for my material, so...

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:54.630
Huh, a source for your material...

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:57.790
Huh?! What...?!

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:03.040
Yours was a romance one, right? Speaking of,
I still haven't read the one you wrote before.

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:04.130
Let me read it.

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:06.040
W-well, one of these days...

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:09.000
Nat-chan!

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:11.380
It's great to see you!

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:13.380
A-Alex...!

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.920
I get to go to the same school as you starting today!

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:18.670
I won't be lonely since you're here, Nat-chan!

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:23.330
Oh, remember, this is the guy I talked about before...
When we caught the underwear thief...

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:32.170
Uh... I'm happy to see you. My name is
Alex J. Matsukawa. Please call me Al-

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.040
In Japanese. Say it in Japanese.

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:37.540
I'm Rui Tachibana. Nice to meet you...

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:42.420
Rui! Rui-chan?! Nice to meetcha! Let's be friends, okay?

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:47.500
By the way, what were you guys talking about
earlier so excitedly? Let me in on it!

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:50.580
We weren't getting excited, but... It was about our club.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:52.540
School clubs!

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:55.920
Club activity, right?! Are you guys in any of them?

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:58.170
Yeah. The Literature Club, more or less.

00:18:58.170 --> 00:18:59.250
Both of you?

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:00.080
Yeah.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.670
Then, I'll join too!

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:05.660
FACULTY ROOM

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.710
So, that's what he's saying, but...

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:10.920
Whaddya think...? It doesn't seem
like he's actually interested in novels, but...

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:14.330
Well, we already set a precedent
with someone like Kashiwabara-kun.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:17.830
Even if you don't write yourself, I'm sure you at least
have a favorite book or something, right?

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.540
The Three Little Pigs!

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:22.000
That's a kid's story!

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:26.210
That's fine. If he wants to join, he's welcome, too.

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:29.790
For you see, there is a merit on our end
to have him become a member.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:31.000
"A merit"?

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:33.580
Oh, have you forgotten?

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:37.790
If there are five people, we get promoted from a meetup
group to club status, and we'll receive a club budget.

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:45.960
It figures that a genuine Yankee would be that crazy.

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:50.790
Well, he's hyper and I kinda get tired of it,
but he's not a bad guy.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:54.830
When I told him about you guys, Yuya and Kazu,
he said, "I wanna be friends with them!"

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:56.460
For real?!

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:59.540
It's kinda exciting that he grew up in America.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:02.250
Hina-chan! Long time no see!

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:04.210
Hina-sensei!

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:07.540
Aw, come on! Were you lonely
that you didn't get to see me during break?

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:09.540
Of course! You were really on my mind!

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:10.790
Seriously?! For real?!

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:12.920
I wondered if you were doing your homework properly.

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:13.420
Ugh...!

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:17.380
Class 4's lessons are this afternoon, right?
They'll be due then, okay?

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:19.580
Um, I kinda forgot them today, so...

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:21.420
Then turn them in tomorrow!

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:22.130
What...?!

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:24.250
Otherwise, I'll give you a penalty!

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:25.710
Seriously...?

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:41.130
Natsuo-kun... What's up?

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:44.080
I'm sorry to ambush you like this...

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:47.290
I have something that I just have to ask you about...

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:51.540
I also thought this
when I went to your place, Sensei, but...

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:56.330
Even though I may be ready, Sensei, maybe you're not.

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:11.670
I'm sorry. It's not that I'm trying to call you on this.

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:15.130
But, I'm feeling insecure and...

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.040
Am I being needy...?

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.960
Don't say that, please...?

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:24.080
Preparing yourself and rushing to die are different...

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:28.710
It's precisely because I want to take good care
of our relationship that I'm being cautious.

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:33.830
My feelings are the same as yours, Natsuo-kun.

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:36.710
I want you to have no doubt about that...

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:38.670
Sensei...

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:43.710
Huh?!

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:47.130
The vice principal just passed through
the hallway over there.

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:53.630
I understand now that you're doing things
like this for our sake...

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:56.960
But, please try not to avoid me too much.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:58.040
Okay...

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:16.670
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni natte yuku

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:16.670
Ah, I'll be selfish to you

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:21.420
Domestic Girlfriend

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:29.010
Sasai na hibi no nandemo nai yasashisa wo

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:29.010
Your little kindness in normal days

00:22:30.420 --> 00:22:38.590
Daiji ni shimatte nandomo akete nagamete iru

00:22:30.420 --> 00:22:38.590
I cherish them and open them often to look

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:47.470
Kimi no honshin kikezu ni karamawari shitari shite

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:47.470
I wouldn't be able to ask you about your feelings and losing my self

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:55.760
Kantan na koto hodo muzukashiku natte iru

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:55.760
The easiest things become harder to do

00:22:56.670 --> 00:22:59.720
Otona ni nareba

00:22:56.670 --> 00:22:59.720
If I become an adult,

00:23:01.050 --> 00:23:12.220
Konna koto de nayamazu ni umaku ikirareru kana

00:23:01.050 --> 00:23:12.220
I can live well without worrying about something like this?

00:23:13.050 --> 00:23:17.470
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni naru

00:23:13.050 --> 00:23:17.470
Ah, I become selfish just towards you

00:23:17.470 --> 00:23:21.670
Dondon jibun rashiku mo nakunatte

00:23:17.470 --> 00:23:21.670
I'll lose my self more & more

00:23:21.800 --> 00:23:26.220
Ah mata kimochi ga sakibashitte

00:23:21.800 --> 00:23:26.220
Ah, my feelings get ahead of myself again

00:23:26.220 --> 00:23:30.720
Dondon matomo ja nakunatteku kara

00:23:26.220 --> 00:23:30.720
I can't stand it more

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:36.170
Sotchi wo minai de

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:36.170
Don't look that way

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:42.540
Episode 10

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:42.540
Liar...

00:23:39.420 --> 00:23:40.750
Liar...
